OL,5,G1700 Shoplifters: Caught Red Handed
OL,6,     FIn Newton Abbot, one of the most
OL,7,     Fprolific shoplifters in town is
OL,8,     Fspotted huddled in a doorway, and
OL,9,     Fin Liverpool, security officers
OL,10,     Ffoil an attempt at a dodgy
OL,11,     Fsupermarket sweep. (Ep20)
OL,12,G1800 Home and Away
OL,13,     FHarper gets a glimpse of Beau's
OL,14,     Ftrue colours. Remi confronts
OL,15,     FSonny. Cash and Levi team up.
OL,16,G1830 Home and Away
OL,17,     FThe boys go bush. Beau begs for
OL,18,     Fanother chance. Dana has big
OL,19,     Fplans. Remi bows out.
