OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FIn Birmingham, Yassin has bald
OL,7,     Fpatches on his head and he's
OL,8,     Fworried it's alopecia areata.
OL,9,     FAsim's face has started swelling,
OL,10,     Fbut there doesn't seem to be an
OL,11,     Fallergic reaction.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FThe IT systems have failed,
OL,14,     Fcausing chaos, but Casualty still
OL,15,     Fneed to treat a motorcycle courier
OL,16,     Fwho's had a head-on collision, and
OL,17,     Fa man with severe abdominal pains.
