OL,5,G2300 Trauma Room One
OL,6,     FSurgeons race to remove a
OL,7,     Flife-threatening brain mass from
OL,8,     F34-year-old Milton, operate on
OL,9,     FAnnie's spinal tumour to prevent
OL,10,     Fparalysis, and perform complex
OL,11,     Fkeyhole surgery on Rob's spine.
OL,12,G0000 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Natalia Spierings meets a
OL,14,     Ffellow body builder with a lump on
OL,15,     Fher shin while Dr Magnus Lynch
OL,16,     Fhelps a golfer with a skin
OL,17,     Fcondition that's affecting her
OL,18,     Fswing.
